<title>UK: SOCCER-INTER-MILAN FAVOURITES TO WIN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER-MILAN FAVOURITES TO WIN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bookmakers William Hill made Inter-Milan 7-4 favourites to win the UEFA Cup after their 7-1 aggregate win over Boavista on Tuesday. Newcastle are second favourites at 4-1. Their other odds are 9-2 Monaco; 5-1 Valencia; 9-1 Tenerife; 10-1 Schalke; 16-1 Anderlecht; 20-1 Brondby.</p>
